 function article(a){shell(`${crumb(`<a href="#/journal">Journal</a>　/　${a[2]}`)}<div class="route-hero"><span class="eyebrow">${a[2]} /</span><h1>${a[1]}</h1><p>${a[3]}　·　${a[4]}<br>${a[5]}</p></div>${image(a[6],a[1])}<article class="article-prose"><aside class="route-card"><b>In short</b><p>${a[7]}</p><p>Every step is explained before it happens. A 3D scan and a written plan help us make care clear.</p></aside><p>${a[7]} At Aveline, we explain your options clearly, show you what we see and answer questions before treatment begins.</p><h2>${a[1]}</h2><p>Our clinicians use modern digital tools and a careful, personal approach. The process begins with an assessment, followed by a plan that fits your needs and schedule.</p><p>During your visit, you can ask us to pause at any time. We talk through what we are doing, why it matters, and what to expect afterwards.</p><h2>What happens, step by step</h2><p>We review your dental history, take any scans or images needed, and explain our findings together. You receive an estimate before any treatment starts.</p><h2>Common questions</h2><p><b>Is it comfortable?</b><br>We take our time and offer comfort options. Tell us about any concerns when booking.</p><p><b>What happens next?</b><br>Your clinician will make a clear follow-up plan with you.</p></article><a class="pill" href="#/team">Written by ${a[3]}　↗</a><section class="route-section"><span class="eyebrow">Journal /</span><h2>Keep reading</h2><div class="route-grid">${articles.filter(x=>x!==a).map(x=>`<a class="route-card" href="#/article/${x[0]}"><h3>${x[1]}</h3><small>${x[2]} · ${x[5]}</small></a>`).join('')}</div></section>`)}
